#. Type: string
#. description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid "Listen address:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. description
#: ../templates:1001
msgid ""
"Choose an IP address assigned to this server. The safe default, 127.0.0.1, "
"allows access only from this machine; use an SSH tunnel for remote access. "
"The wildcard addresses 0.0.0.0 and :: listen on all interfaces and should "
"only be used when remote access is intentionally secured. You can change "
"this later in /etc/firewall-web/firewall-web.env; then run systemctl restart "
"firewall-web.service."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. description
#: ../templates:2001
msgid "TCP port:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. description
#: ../templates:2001
msgid ""
"Choose an unused TCP port from 1 to 65535. The default is 5005. You can "
"change this later in /etc/firewall-web/firewall-web.env; then run systemctl "
"restart firewall-web.service."
msgstr ""

#. Type: password
#. description
#: ../templates:3001
msgid "Four-digit authentication PIN:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: password
#. description
#: ../templates:3001
msgid ""
"Enter exactly four digits. Leave this blank to generate a cryptographically "
"random four-digit PIN, including possible leading zeroes. A generated PIN is "
"saved root-only in /var/lib/firewall-web/initial-pin; retrieve it with sudo "
"cat /var/lib/firewall-web/initial-pin, then securely remove that file. The "
"PIN is never shown in package logs. You can change it later in /etc/firewall-"
"web/firewall-web.env; then run systemctl restart firewall-web.service."
msgstr ""

#. Type: select
#. description
#: ../templates:4001
msgid "Firewall manager selection:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: select
#. description
#: ../templates:4001
msgid ""
"Choose auto to detect the existing manager conservatively. Inspection mode "
"is read-only. This setting does not install, activate, or modify any "
"firewall manager. You can change it later in /etc/firewall-web/firewall-web."
"env; then run systemctl restart firewall-web.service."
msgstr ""

